<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<WorkflowBuilder Version="2.9.0"
                 xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
                 xmlns:rx="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Reactive;assembly=Bonsai.Core"
                 xmlns:scr="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Scripting.Expressions;assembly=Bonsai.Scripting.Expressions"
                 xmlns:trl="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Trials;assembly=OpenRigs.Trials"
                 xmlns:zap="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Devices.Zapit;assembly=OpenRigs.Devices"
                 xmlns="https://bonsai-rx.org/2018/workflow">
  <Description>Zapit's trials, the same in every task: give it the trials' rules (TrialRules, once, at Go). In an optogenetics experiment (the rules' Laser, a LaserTiming, is set) each trial's StartStimulus (ArmZapit: its condition, laser on at the trial's power or off at 0 mW) goes into ZapitCommands, at the trial's Arm event on a hardware-triggered rig, else at its Trigger, all as the rules' Laser gives it. The laser's stop is the rules' Laser too: LaserTiming.ForDuration plays it for its laserDurationSeconds; LaserTiming.UntilOutcome (no duration) plays it until StopZapit, sent once per trial from its trigger at whichever comes first of its outcome, its LaserCap (laserMaxSeconds on the Harp clock) or LaserBackstop (laserMaxSeconds on the computer's clock, should the board stall: the one wall-clock wait). The ZapitTrigger line is raised at each Trigger and cleared at each TriggerOff (SetZapitTriggerLine, on BehaviorBoard-Main.Commands). TrialLoop checks Zapit's replies. Needs TrialEvents, ZapitCommands (OpenRigs.Devices ConnectForTask) and ZapitTriggerLine from the workflow.</Description>
  <Workflow>
    <Nodes>
      <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
        <Name>Source1</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
        <Name>Optogenetics?</Name>
        <Description>An optogenetics experiment: the rules have a laser.</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
              <Name>Source1</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
              <scr:Expression>Laser != null</scr:Expression>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
        <Selector>Laser</Selector>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:SelectMany">
        <Name>Zapit</Name>
        <Description>Once at Go, with the rules' laser timing (ZapitLaser): each trial's StartStimulus, and the laser's stop when it has no duration.</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
              <Name>Source1</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
              <Name>ZapitLaser</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TrialEvents</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="trl:PickTrialEvents">
                <trl:Kind>Arm</trl:Kind>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>Trial</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TrialEvents</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="trl:PickTrialEvents">
                <trl:Kind>Trigger</trl:Kind>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>Trial</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>ZapitLaser</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
              <PropertyMappings>
                <Property Name="HardwareTriggered" Selector="HardwareTriggered" />
                <Property Name="DurationSeconds" Selector="LaserDurationSeconds" />
              </PropertyMappings>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Name>ArmZapit</Name>
              <Description>Each trial's StartStimulus (its condition, laser on with the trial's power or off at 0 mW, for the laser's laserDurationSeconds, or until StopZapit with none). On a hardware-triggered rig sent at Arm, during the interval; without, Zapit starts the laser on receipt, so it is sent at the Trigger.</Description>
              <Combinator xsi:type="trl:ZapitTrialCommand">
                <trl:HardwareTriggered>false</trl:HardwareTriggered>
                <trl:DurationSeconds>0</trl:DurationSeconds>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>ZapitCommands</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>ZapitLaser</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
              <Name>UntilOutcome?</Name>
              <Description>A laser with no duration (LaserTiming.UntilOutcome) plays until stopped.</Description>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                    <Name>Source1</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
                    <scr:Expression>Item2.LaserDurationSeconds == 0</scr:Expression>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
              <scr:Name>LaserMax</scr:Name>
              <scr:Expression>TimeSpan.FromSeconds(Item2.LaserMaxSeconds)</scr:Expression>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:SelectMany">
              <Name>LaserOnUntilOutcome</Name>
              <Description>From the trigger, stops Zapit once: at the trial's outcome, at its LaserCap (laserMaxSeconds on the Harp clock), or at laserMaxSeconds on the wall clock (LaserBackstop), should the board stall. A trial that ends before its trigger has no laser; the next StartStimulus disarms it.</Description>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                    <Name>Source1</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>TrialEvents</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="trl:PickTrialEvents">
                      <trl:Kind>Outcome</trl:Kind>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>TrialEvents</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="trl:PickTrialEvents">
                      <trl:Kind>LaserCap</trl:Kind>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
                    <PropertyMappings>
                      <Property Name="DueTime" />
                    </PropertyMappings>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Name>LaserBackstop</Name>
                    <Description>Stops Zapit laserMaxSeconds after the trigger on the computer's clock, should the Harp board stall so that LaserCap never comes: the one wall-clock wait. Whichever of the three comes first stops the laser.</Description>
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Timer">
                      <rx:DueTime>PT0S</rx:DueTime>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Merge" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                      <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="zap:StopZapit" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
                    <Name>ZapitCommands</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                  <Expression xsi:type="Unit" />
                  <Expression xsi:type="Unit" />
                  <Expression xsi:type="Unit" />
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="0" To="5" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="2" To="12" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="4" To="13" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="6" To="14" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="12" To="7" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="13" To="7" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="14" To="7" Label="Source3" />
                  <Edge From="7" To="8" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="9" To="10" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="10" To="11" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="4" To="10" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="7" To="10" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="9" To="10" Label="Source3" />
            <Edge From="10" To="11" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="11" To="12" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="7" To="14" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="13" To="14" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="14" To="15" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="15" To="16" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="16" To="17" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
        <Name>TrialEvents</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="trl:PickTrialEvents">
          <trl:Kind>Trigger</trl:Kind>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Devices:SetZapitTriggerLine.bonsai">
        <Set>true</Set>
        <BoardCommandsSubjectName>BehaviorBoard-Main.Commands</BoardCommandsSubjectName>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
        <Name>TrialEvents</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="trl:PickTrialEvents">
          <trl:Kind>TriggerOff</trl:Kind>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Devices:SetZapitTriggerLine.bonsai">
        <Set>false</Set>
        <BoardCommandsSubjectName>BehaviorBoard-Main.Commands</BoardCommandsSubjectName>
      </Expression>
    </Nodes>
    <Edges>
      <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="7" To="8" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source1" />
    </Edges>
  </Workflow>
</WorkflowBuilder>
